Project 3: Automated Enterprise Network & Endpoint Management Tools
Overview
A collection of modular PowerShell and Python automation tools designed for network environment validation, system diagnostics, and administrative task automation.

Key Features
Network Health Diagnostic Suite: PowerShell script that validates VLAN routing, DNS resolution, bandwidth limits, and ping latencies across subnets.
System Auditing & Compliance: Python utility that parses local and remote system configuration files against baseline security benchmarks.
Log Analysis Tool: CLI tool using Python to parse server logs (Nginx, Syslog, or Windows Event Logs) for rapid root-cause analysis of incidents.
